            <description>
                <![CDATA[<img src="https://fed.hust.edu.vn/assets/feed/news/2026_06/02-toan-canh-hoi-nghi.jpg" width="100" align="left" border="0">On 5–6 June 2026, Assoc. Prof. Le Hieu Hoc, Dean of the Faculty of Education, Hanoi University of Science and Technology (HUST), and Chair of IPDA Vietnam, participated in the Annual Conference of the International Professional Development Association (IPDA) held in Dublin, Ireland. The conference, themed “The Professional Learning Atlas: Mapping Frontiers in Research, Policy, and Practice,” brought together scholars, educational leaders, and practitioners from around the world to discuss emerging trends and innovations in professional learning.]]>
